{
  "name": "AI Carousel + Generate Gambar + Post Instagram",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 🔄 Alur Lengkap\n\n1. User kirim pesan ke bot\n2. AI buat konten carousel\n3. Ringkasan + detail slide dikirim\n4. Bot tanya: \"Generate gambar?\"\n5. User klik ✅ Ya → Gambar di-generate per slide via Gemini Imagen\n6. Setiap gambar dikirim ke Telegram dengan caption\n7. User klik ❌ Tidak → Selesai tanpa gambar",
        "color": 2
      },
      "id": "3daf50c7-55c3-42fc-8a40-2d20789b672b",
      "name": "Sticky Note e18109df",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
